    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>TOURNAMENT MODE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FJN Blackjack Cup features an exciting 64-Player knockout blackjack tournament.\u00a0 Make strategic decisions as you try to earn as many chips as possible before the end of the tournament.\u00a0 Climb the tournament leaderboards and compete for the championship against your tournament rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>BLACKJACK GAME ENGINE</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play blackjack on one of the most realistic blackjack engines ever built.\u00a0 Experience what it's like to play professional tournament blackjack and make tough decisions along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>GAME FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Blackjack Engine\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tournament Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HDRP Graphics Engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play-by-Play Commentary\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
